OVERVIEW: Add a model to the registry

USAGE: dicom-ai registry add --name <name> --path <path> [--version <version>] --type <type> [--description <description>] [--input-width <input-width>] [--input-height <input-height>] [--output-type <output-type>] [--tags <tags>] [--overwrite] [--verbose]

OPTIONS:
  -n, --name <name>       Model name
  --path <path>           Model path (.mlmodel or .mlmodelc)
  --version <version>     Model version (e.g., 1.0.0) (default: 1.0.0)
  --type <type>           Model type: classification, segmentation, detection,
                          enhancement, other
  --description <description>
                          Model description
  --input-width <input-width>
                          Input width
  --input-height <input-height>
                          Input height
  --output-type <output-type>
                          Output type: classification, segmentation, detection,
                          image, multiArray (default: classification)
  --tags <tags>           Tags (comma-separated)
  --overwrite             Overwrite if model already exists
  --verbose               Verbose output
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

